TestNG(Next generation)
Apache Foundation.
Its an open source/ free to use
One of the most popular unit testing framework

1. Advantages
	a. Makes automation test execution easier.
	b. you can group test cases or collection of multiple tc's
	c. set priority on test cases
		login -> plp -> pdp - logout
	d. Uses Anotations
	 a. @Test
	 b. @BeforeTest
	 c. @AfterTest
	 d. @BeforeMethod
	 e. @AfterMethod
	 f. @BeforeClass
	 g. @AfterClass
	 i. @DataProvider
	 j. priority (method)
	
	e.Allows tester to generate Reports.
	 1. normal report
	 2. html report - extent reports / allure report.
	
	f.  Cross browser testing
		run single test on multiple browser
		single test on single browser
		parallel execution.
	
	g. allow user to re-use selenium scripts.			 
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	
	 	